"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-[#788E73]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#7BA23F]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>Overnight Family Stay (8 Guests)</span></div></div><div class=\"py-6 sm:py-8\"><p class=\"font-serif text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#141715] font-light leading-relaxed italic\">“<!-- -->We visited with 8 family members for an overnight retreat. The chulha-cooked chicken curry with hot rice bhakri was truly unforgettable. Spotlessly clean cottage rooms, tranquil pool, and crisp morning air under the pomelo trees.<!-- -->”</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-[rgba(139,130,88,0.14)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#141715] text-[#FAF8F3] font-serif font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-xs\">VD</div><div><span class=\"font-serif font-bold text-[#141715] text-base block leading-none\">Dr. Vikram Deshmukh</span><span class=\"text-xs text-[#56635A] mt-0.5 block font-sans\">Bandra West, Mumbai</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-[#788E73]\">Visited November 2026</span><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#141715] bg-[#F2EDE2] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md\">0<!-- -->1<!-- --> / 0<!-- -->5</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-6 px-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"transition-all duration-300 rounded-full cursor-pointer w-8 h-2.5 bg-[#141715]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"transition-all duration-300 rounded-full cursor-pointer w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.3)] hover:bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.6)]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"transition-all duration-300 rounded-full cursor-pointer w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.3)] hover:bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.6)]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"transition-all duration-300 rounded-full cursor-pointer w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.3)] hover:bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.6)]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 4\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"transition-all duration-300 rounded-full cursor-pointer w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.3)] hover:bg-[rgba(139,130,88,0.6)]\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 5\"></button></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-[#FAF8F3] border border-[rgba(139,130,88,0.25)] flex items-center justify-center text-[#141715] shadow-xs hover:shadow transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Previous review\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-10 h-10 sm:w-11 sm:h-11 rounded-full bg-[#141715] hover:bg-[#28302b] text-[#FAF8F3] flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs hover:shadow transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Next review\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-5 h-5 text-[#FAF8F3]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section id=\"location\" class=\"py-14 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto scroll-mt-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-6 space-y-5\"><div><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-[#788E73] block mb-1\">Gentle Transit</span><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#141715]\">Getting to Pomelo Garden</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#56635A] mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Tandulwadi Road, Saphale (East), Palghar. An easy, scenic drive from Mumbai or a quick 10-minute auto ride from Saphale Station.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2.5 font-sans text-xs\"><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE2] flex items-center justify-between border border-[rgba(139,130,88,0.16)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass w-4 h-4 text-[#788E73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-medium text-[#141715]\">Saphale Railway Station</span></div><span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-[#E06354]\">7 km (10-12 mins)</span></div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE2] flex items-center justify-between border border-[rgba(139,130,88,0.16)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-waves-horizontal lucide-waves w-4 h-4 text-[#788E73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 12q2.5 2 5 0t5 0 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M2 19q2.5 2 5 0t5 0 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M2 5q2.5 2 5 0t5 0 5 0 5 0\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-medium text-[#141715]\">Kelwa Beach &amp; Historic Fort</span></div><span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-[#E06354]\">14 km (20 mins)</span></div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#F2EDE2] flex items-center justify-between border border-[rgba(139,130,88,0.16)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car w-4 h-4 text-[#788E73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span class=\"font-medium text-[#141715]\">Mumbai (via Western Express Highway)</span></div><span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-[#E06354]\">85 km (~1h 45m)</span></div></div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#7BA23F]/10 border border-[#7BA23F]/20 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs text-[#56635A]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-4 h-4 text-[#7BA23F] shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z\"></path></svg><span>On-site EV fast charger (11 kW Type-2) available for overnight guests.</span></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\"><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-[#F2EDE2] border border-[rgba(139,130,88,0.2)] p-2.5 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"w-full h-80 rounded-xl overflow