las</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#141715] transition-colors\" href=\"/rooms?checkIn=&amp;checkOut=&amp;adults=2&amp;children=0\">Deluxe Cottages</a></li><li><a href=\"#kitchen\" class=\"hover:text-[#141715] transition-colors\">Chulha Bhakri Dining</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wa.me/919850607607?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20staying%20at%20Pomelo%20Garden%20Saphale%20for%20%20to%20%20(2%20Adults).%20Please%20assist!\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:text-[#141715] transition-colors\">Property Buyouts 20+</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 space-y-3 text-xs\"><span class=\"uppercase font-bold tracking-wider text-[#141715] block font-mono text-[11px]\">Orchard Notes &amp; Harvest Alerts</span><p class=\"text-xs text-[#56635A] leading-relaxed\">Receive alerts when sweet pomelos are in harvest and secret weekend getaway dates open.</p><form class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter email or WhatsApp...\" required=\"\" class=\"flex-1 h-10 px-3.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-[rgba(139,130,88,0.25)] text-xs text-[#141715] placeholder-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#141715] font-sans\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"h-10 px-5 rounded-full bg-[#141715] text-[#FAF8F3] hover:bg-[#28302b] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors shrink-0 cursor-pointer\">Subscribe</button></form></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#56635A]\"><p>© 2026 Pomelo Garden. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#8B8258]\">Hosted with care by Mr. &amp; Mrs. Raut</span><a class=\"text-xs text-[#141715] font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/admin/login\"><span>Staff Ledger</span><span>↗</span></a></div></div></div></footer><div class=\"fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 z-30 sm:hidden bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md